{"chunk_id": "fia-f1-2026-section-c-issue-20:C5.1.1:article:001", "strategy": "article", "text": "Only 4-stroke engines with reciprocating pistons are permitted.", "metadata": {"corpus_id": "fia-f1-2026-engine-subset-v1", "document_id": "fia-f1-2026-section-c-issue-20", "logical_document_id": "fia-f1-2026-section-c", "season": 2026, "section": "C", "issue": 20, "document_date": "2026-08-05", "article_id": "C5.1.1", "article_heading": null, "parent_heading": "Engine specification", "pdf_page": 61, "printed_page": "C61", "source_url": "https://www.fia.com/system/files/documents/fia_2026_f1_regulations_-_section_c_technical_-_iss_20_-_2026-08-05.pdf", "source_sha256": "cf0b919eef5eecc27497fb6de012f8d27e200f6dbd34d62b7e5385f7274ff652", "parent_record_id": "fia-f1-2026-section-c-issue-20:C5.1.1", "parent_text_sha256": "fdf105ef81d255a0759565ab97d7ee484398d8befabd1d1fa2df52fe40918047", "parent_unresolved_cross_references": [], "start_index": 0, "end_index_exclusive": 63}}
{"chunk_id": "fia-f1-2026-section-c-issue-20:C5.1.2:article:001", "strategy": "article", "text": "Engine cubic capacity must be 1600cc (+0/−10cc).", "metadata": {"corpus_id": "fia-f1-2026-engine-subset-v1", "document_id": "fia-f1-2026-section-c-issue-20", "logical_document_id": "fia-f1-2026-section-c", "season": 2026, "section": "C", "issue": 20, "document_date": "2026-08-05", "article_id": "C5.1.2", "article_heading": null, "parent_heading": "Engine specification", "pdf_page": 61, "printed_page": "C61", "source_url": "https://www.fia.com/system/files/documents/fia_2026_f1_regulations_-_section_c_technical_-_iss_20_-_2026-08-05.pdf", "source_sha256": "cf0b919eef5eecc27497fb6de012f8d27e200f6dbd34d62b7e5385f7274ff652", "parent_record_id": "fia-f1-2026-section-c-issue-20:C5.1.2", "parent_text_sha256": "faf36e240a4554eb499d0440814630f36df07e0604e46cbea9b4dc0097ea5e82", "parent_unresolved_cross_references": [], "start_index": 0, "end_index_exclusive": 48}}
{"chunk_id": "fia-f1-2026-section-c-issue-20:C5.1.3:article:001", "strategy": "article", "text": "All engines must have six cylinders arranged in a 90° “V” configuration and the normal section of each cylinder must be circular. All six cylinders must be of equal capacity.", "metadata": {"corpus_id": "fia-f1-2026-engine-subset-v1", "document_id": "fia-f1-2026-section-c-issue-20", "logical_document_id": "fia-f1-2026-section-c", "season": 2026, "section": "C", "issue": 20, "document_date": "2026-08-05", "article_id": "C5.1.3", "article_heading": null, "parent_heading": "Engine specification", "pdf_page": 61, "printed_page": "C61", "source_url": "https://www.fia.com/system/files/documents/fia_2026_f1_regulations_-_section_c_technical_-_iss_20_-_2026-08-05.pdf", "source_sha256": "cf0b919eef5eecc27497fb6de012f8d27e200f6dbd34d62b7e5385f7274ff652", "parent_record_id": "fia-f1-2026-section-c-issue-20:C5.1.3", "parent_text_sha256": "2f129ed0a52b0f9c23dbc92b7ddc7effd482b751315407ec01b7dff05c9f78aa", "parent_unresolved_cross_references": [], "start_index": 0, "end_index_exclusive": 174}}
{"chunk_id": "fia-f1-2026-section-c-issue-20:C5.1.4:article:001", "strategy": "article", "text": "Engines must have two intake and two exhaust valves per cylinder. Only reciprocating poppet valves with axial displacement mechanically actuated by the camshafts are permitted. The sealing interface between the moving valve component and the stationary engine component must be circular. The sealing surfaces on the stationary engine component must be either the Cylinder Head itself defined by C5.7.8 g), any coating on the Cylinder Head permitted by C5.6.2, or the conventional Inserts permitted by C5.1.7 a).", "metadata": {"corpus_id": "fia-f1-2026-engine-subset-v1", "document_id": "fia-f1-2026-section-c-issue-20", "logical_document_id": "fia-f1-2026-section-c", "season": 2026, "section": "C", "issue": 20, "document_date": "2026-08-05", "article_id": "C5.1.4", "article_heading": null, "parent_heading": "Engine specification", "pdf_page": 61, "printed_page": "C61", "source_url": "https://www.fia.com/system/files/documents/fia_2026_f1_regulations_-_section_c_technical_-_iss_20_-_2026-08-05.pdf", "source_sha256": "cf0b919eef5eecc27497fb6de012f8d27e200f6dbd34d62b7e5385f7274ff652", "parent_record_id": "fia-f1-2026-section-c-issue-20:C5.1.4", "parent_text_sha256": "e4eff4df47a731a65d4fa1562b10a8660f5038a25152c8d464ca417b1cae3a18", "parent_unresolved_cross_references": ["C5.7.8 g)", "C5.6.2", "C5.1.7 a)"], "start_index": 0, "end_index_exclusive": 511}}
{"chunk_id": "fia-f1-2026-section-c-issue-20:C5.1.18:article:001", "strategy": "article", "text": "Unless stated otherwise any numerical values specified in Article C5 will be static values at ambient temperature", "metadata": {"corpus_id": "fia-f1-2026-engine-subset-v1", "document_id": "fia-f1-2026-section-c-issue-20", "logical_document_id": "fia-f1-2026-section-c", "season": 2026, "section": "C", "issue": 20, "document_date": "2026-08-05", "article_id": "C5.1.18", "article_heading": "Treatment of Numerical Values", "parent_heading": "Engine specification", "pdf_page": 62, "printed_page": "C62", "source_url": "https://www.fia.com/system/files/documents/fia_2026_f1_regulations_-_section_c_technical_-_iss_20_-_2026-08-05.pdf", "source_sha256": "cf0b919eef5eecc27497fb6de012f8d27e200f6dbd34d62b7e5385f7274ff652", "parent_record_id": "fia-f1-2026-section-c-issue-20:C5.1.18", "parent_text_sha256": "9266be2de2157d812fc362541d310dae1b123002e57547bd060494c10df9224e", "parent_unresolved_cross_references": [], "start_index": 0, "end_index_exclusive": 113}}
